      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POETIC STAR (2) ran a good time (23.53) winning a Grade 5 two back at Horsham but missed the frame latest finishing fourth at this track. Will find this more suitable and can atone. BULL DURHAM (1) produced a moderate run last time when seventh at this track over 400m behind Moyarra Kongk (23.67) in a Grade 5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to his credit. Should be in this for a long way. MR. KIA ORA (4) scored by a space in one of the fastest times of the card two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 5th and beaten 7 lengths at Geelong (22.88). Worth following up. EXTREMITY (8) took up a forward position and go the job done last time out. That form reads well.",
